    "Municipal filtration has to account for the vehicle mission as well as the engine. Repeated stop-start duty, idling, urban dust, refuse debris, auxiliary hydraulics and route schedules change which systems are critical and how service should be planned.": "A filtração municipal deve considerar a missão do veículo além do motor. Partidas repetidas, marcha lenta, poeira, resíduos, hidráulica auxiliar e rotas determinam os sistemas críticos e a manutenção.",
    "ROUTE OPERATING REALITY": "REALIDADE OPERACIONAL DAS ROTAS",
    "The route defines the duty cycle.": "A rota determina o ciclo de trabalho.",
    "Waste collection, sweeping, sewer service and public works combine road travel with stationary or low-speed work. That operating pattern creates a filtration problem that is different from conventional highway duty.": "Coleta, varrição, esgoto e obras públicas combinam deslocamentos com tarefas estacionárias ou lentas. Esse uso exige filtração diferente do serviço rodoviário comum.",
    "PUBLIC-SERVICE ASSETS": "ATIVOS DOS SERVIÇOS PÚBLICOS",
